    "statement": "Development target, not a completed support claim. The repository Django provider (parseDjangoModels, ingestion t10-provider in the persistence catalog) is compared with the schema facts that Django 6.1.2 derives from the fixture model classes in an app registry configured without any database. Constructs marked supported match that oracle for the listed facets on the listed fixtures at the pinned version; every other construct is listed with how the provider omits, leaves unknown or mishandles it. Nothing was run against a database or an application runtime."
  },
